WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.851
A pattern rule expresses the starting amount and change using a letter such as n.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:11.470
A rule starts at 23 and increases by 4 per step. Which expression describes it? The

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:16.879
answer is 23 plus 4n. Initial value 23, then add 4 for each step n.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.983
A price table during a library project starts at 19 and adds 2 for each new step.

00:00:22.983 --> 00:00:27.023
Which expression gives the value at step n? Pause the video and think.

00:00:27.867 --> 00:00:33.316
A price table during a library project starts at 19 and adds 2 for each new step.

00:00:33.316 --> 00:00:38.444
Which expression gives the value at step n? The answer is 19 plus 2n. Initial value

00:00:38.444 --> 00:00:41.008
19, then add 2 for each step n.
